{"fact_id":"f-manhattan-0082","specimen":"manhattan-project","subject_id":"weld-main","predicate":"contribution_share","value":{"W_A_fission_physics":0.45,"W_B_war_state_institutional":0.55},"source":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manhattan_Project","title":"Manhattan Project — Wikipedia","type":"encyclopedia","published_or_updated":"2026-05-01"},"retrieved_at":"2026-06-10T02:25:02Z","certainty":0.3,"verification":"pending","agent":"fable-harvester-01","notes":"ESTIMATE: basis = specimen's own analysis (W_A = physics possibility, W_B = realization capacity). The specimen notes W_B-as-single-parent holds at ~0.6 confidence while physics alone never consummated (German Uranverein as negative control). The institutional/war-state parent arguably contributed more to the TEMPO (>80% of $2bn went to production plants, not physics). However the physics parent was the sine qua non for the direction/goal. Rough split 45/55 favoring war-state for this consummated case, reflecting that exogenous forcing was decisive for tempo. Historiographic basis is qualitative; not a quantitative claim. certainty capped at 0.3 per contribution_share rules."}
{"fact_id":"f-manhattan-0083","specimen":"manhattan-project","subject_id":"weld-main","predicate":"contribution_share","value":{"szilard_conceiver":0.15,"oppenheimer_integrator":0.12,"fermi_chain_reaction":0.12,"groves_mobilizer":0.12,"bush_organizational":0.10,"emigre_physicists":0.20,"anonymous_workers":0.19},"source":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manhattan_Project","title":"Manhattan Project — Wikipedia","type":"encyclopedia","published_or_updated":"2026-05-01"},"retrieved_at":"2026-06-10T02:25:02Z","certainty":0.2,"verification":"pending","agent":"fable-harvester-01","notes":"ESTIMATE: historiographic basis = the specimen's own credit discrepancy analysis (discrepancies[6]). Popular attribution: Einstein/Oppenheimer ~0.5 credit in public discourse (but grossly overstated per record). Distributed reality per specimen: Szilard (conceiver of chain reaction + letter), emigre physicists (decisive expertise), Fermi (CP-1 proof), Groves (mobilizer), Bush (org method), ~130,000 workers (actual production). This allocation is highly uncertain (certainty 0.2) and is a proxy distribution to surface the discrepancy, not a defensible quantification. No scholarly source provides an authoritative share breakdown."}
